  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremiah Thrown Into a Cistern",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shephatiah son of Mattan, Gedaliah son of Pashhur, Jehukal",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Shelemiah, and Pashhur son of Malkijah heard what Jeremiah was telling all the people when he said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'Whoever stays in this city will die by the sword, famine or plague, but whoever goes over to the Babylonians",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "will live. They will escape with their lives; they will live.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'This city will certainly be given into the hands of the army of the king of Babylon, who will capture it.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the officials said to the king, \"This man should be put to death. He is discouraging the soldiers who are left in this city, as well as all the people, by the things he is saying to them. This man is not seeking the good of these people but their ruin.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He is in your hands,\" King Zedekiah answered. \"The king can do nothing to oppose you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they took Jeremiah and put him into the cistern of Malkijah, the king's son, which was in the courtyard of the guard. They lowered Jeremiah by ropes into the cistern; it had no water in it, only mud, and Jeremiah sank down into the mud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Ebed-Melek, a Cushite,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "an official",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "in the royal palace, heard that they had put Jeremiah into the cistern. While the king was sitting in the Benjamin Gate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebed-Melek went out of the palace and said to him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"My lord the king, these men have acted wickedly in all they have done to Jeremiah the prophet. They have thrown him into a cistern, where he will starve to death when there is no longer any bread in the city.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the king commanded Ebed-Melek the Cushite, \"Take thirty men from here with you and lift Jeremiah the prophet out of the cistern before he dies.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Ebed-Melek took the men with him and went to a room under the treasury in the palace. He took some old rags and worn-out clothes from there and let them down with ropes to Jeremiah in the cistern.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebed-Melek the Cushite said to Jeremiah, \"Put these old rags and worn-out clothes under your arms to pad the ropes.\" Jeremiah did so,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they pulled him up with the ropes and lifted him out of the cistern. And Jeremiah remained in the courtyard of the guard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zedekiah Questions Jeremiah Again",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Zedekiah sent for Jeremiah the prophet and had him brought to the third entrance to the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". \"I am going to ask you something,\" the king said to Jeremiah. \"Do not hide anything from me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeremiah said to Zedekiah, \"If I give you an answer, will you not kill me? Even if I did give you counsel, you would not listen to me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But King Zedekiah swore this oath secretly to Jeremiah: \"As surely as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives, who has given us breath, I will neither kill you nor hand you over to those who want to kill you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jeremiah said to Zedekiah, \"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God Almighty, the God of Israel, says: 'If you surrender to the officers of the king of Babylon, your life will be spared and this city will not be burned down; you and your family will live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if you will not surrender to the officers of the king of Babylon, this city will be given into the hands of the Babylonians and they will burn it down; you yourself will not escape from them.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Zedekiah said to Jeremiah, \"I am afraid of the Jews who have gone over to the Babylonians, for the Babylonians may hand me over to them and they will mistreat me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"They will not hand you over,\" Jeremiah replied. \"Obey the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by doing what I tell you. Then it will go well with you, and your life will be spared.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if you refuse to surrender, this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.38.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.38.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has revealed to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the women left in the palace of the king of Judah will be brought out to the officials of the king of Babylon. Those women will say to you:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 38:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'They misled you and overcame you—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 38:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "those trusted friends of yours.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 38:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Your feet are sunk in the mud;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 38:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "your friends have deserted you.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"All your wives and children will be brought out to the Babylonians. You yourself will not escape from their hands but will be captured by the king of Babylon; and this city will",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "be burned down.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Zedekiah said to Jeremiah, \"Do not let anyone know about this conversation, or you may die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the officials hear that I talked with you, and they come to you and say, 'Tell us what you said to the king and what the king said to you; do not hide it from us or we will kill you,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then tell them, 'I was pleading with the king not to send me back to Jonathan's house to die there.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the officials did come to Jeremiah and question him, and he told them everything the king had ordered him to say. So they said no more to him, for no one had heard his conversation with the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jeremiah remained in the courtyard of the guard until the day Jerusalem was captured.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1",
        "vid": "JER 38:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Fall of Jerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JER 38:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "This is how Jerusalem was taken:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
